  "title": "Personalized Rainbow Hearts Classroom Doormat, Non-Slip Backing",
  "handle": "personalized-rainbow-hearts-classroom-doormat-non-slip-backing",
  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat is designed to welcome students with a warm and inviting entrance. Featuring a composition notebook style, it offers a special touch for any classroom. It serves as a decorative and functional item, perfect for creating a friendly atmosphere in educational spaces.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with a teacher's name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>Made with a soft and durable non-woven fabric top.</li>\n<li>Neoprene rubber backing provides non-slip functionality.</li>\n<li>Effectively traps dirt, dust, and grime to keep floors clean.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor classroom use.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Personalization</td>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap; avoid bleaching; air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This doormat is ideal for classrooms, entryways, and RVs, offering a welcoming touch to any educational or personal space. Its versatile design makes it suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings.</p>",
